          <p class="lead text-gray" style="max-width:850px">E-commerce in Pakistan has undergone a dramatic transformation. With the breakout popularity of local suppliers like HHC Dropshipping, Zambeel, and Sada Dropshipping, combined with next-generation cash-on-delivery (COD) courier networks like PostEx, starting a high-profit Shopify dropshipping store in Pakistan has never been more lucrative or accessible. Here is your definitive, end-to-end 2026 playbook.</p>
